1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:00,840
Thirty-four.

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:06,741
That's how many times, on the record, Donald Trump said the Iran war would end soon.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:11,562
Or that it was almost over. Or that a deal to end it was days away.

4
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:15,843
We went through eight months of speeches, interviews and posts.

5
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:19,864
We counted every one we could prove, with the date and the source.

6
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,124
Then we looked at something else.

7
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:26,965
We checked what bitcoin and oil actually did, on every one of those days.

8
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:28,925
The answer surprised us.
